本書逐章研讀提摩太後書全書四章，並附參考資料附錄，整合黃長老 Thursday 查經筆記中真實的「盡職四大點」服事框架（恩賜挑旺起來、善道靠聖靈守住、恩典上剛強、無愧的工人按正意分解真道）、John MacArthur 逐節解經講道，以及 G. Campbell Morgan 的屬靈組織分析。這是保羅在羅馬馬梅爾監獄等候殉道前，寫給屬靈兒子提摩太最後的書信——從挑旺恩賜、到基督精兵的紀律、到末世的警戒，直到「那美好的仗我已經打過了」的臨終見證，全卷示範一位屬靈父親如何用自己的一生，向下一代交託忠心到底的呼召。

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ chapter-by-chapter study of all four chapters of 2 Timothy, with a references appendix, integrating Elder Wong's authentic "Four Points of Fulfilling Ministry" framework (from his real, dated Thursday study notes) alongside John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis. This is Paul's final letter, written from the Mamertine Prison in Rome awaiting martyrdom, to his spiritual son Timothy — from fanning the gift into flame, through the discipline of Christ's soldier, to the warnings of the last days, culminating in his dying testimony: "I have fought the good fight." The whole book models how a spiritual father hands off a lifetime's charge of faithfulness to the next generation.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

